_issues":55,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-11-12T06:59:47Z","updated_at":"2026-11-25T10:05:33Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":26,"created_at":"2026-11-05T05:26:18Z","updated_at":"2026-11-17T03:10:28Z","closed_at":"2026-11-17T03:10:05Z","assignee":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"status":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"parent_issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/8983","issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Parent: [#6028](https://github.com/developing-today/code/issues/6028) (delta-only ingestion + offset embeds). Research source: prior-art doc `~/workspace/scratch/atlas-ingestion-brief-2026-11-04/prior-art-research.md` (2026-11-04). Follow-up 4 (Cluster 1).\n\n## Finding (research, in substance)\n\nRAG chunking evidence: fixed-size 256–512 tokens with 10–20% overlap is the baseline, but **structural splitting** (markdown headings, code definitions, log-entry boundaries) beats fixed and semantic splitting on technical corpora — authors already segmented the text. Recursive (paragraph→sentence→token) is the strong cheap default; semantic chunking costs an extra embedding pass, over-fragments, and benchmarks below recursive in comparison guides. Overlap past ~20% is mostly waste (index inflation + near-duplicate hits deduped at retrieval anyway). Sources: https://dev.to/dishant_sethi/rag-pipeline-chunking-strategies-split-documents-for-better-retrieval-aoe\n\n## Scope\n\n- Per-source-type policy: markdown/docs (heading structure), code (definition boundaries), logs (entry boundaries), chat/session stores (message/turn boundaries), fixed-window fallback where no structure exists.\n- Overlap defaults per type (structural boundaries need less), and how policy interacts with span reuse (a policy change re-chunks → which spans survive?).\n\n## Done looks like\n\nA policy table per source type with splitter, size targets, overlap, and the migration note for existing chunks.\n\n<!-- agent-note:v1 agent=muse state=filed source=main-chat-2026-11-04-wave2 -->","closed_by":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezr